{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/5c/26/34291_crt_T2dqj.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/5c/26/34291_crt_T2dqj.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/5c/26/34291_crt_T2dqj.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/5c/26/34291_crt_T2dqj.jpg"},"name":"ローニャ","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/a9/6f/18600_prsn_LGgtC.jpg?r=1585323843","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/a9/6f/18600_prsn_LGgtC.jpg?r=1585323843","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a9/6f/18600_prsn_LGgtC.jpg?r=1585323843","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/a9/6f/18600_prsn_LGgtC.jpg?r=1585323843"},"name":"白石晴香","short_summary":"白石晴香（日文名：白石 晴香，纯假名：しらいし はるか，罗马字：Shiraishi Haruka），1995年4月8日出生于东京都，日本女性声优、演员，现所属Toy's Factory事务所（原属Hirata Office）。演员出身，在声优活动之外仍持续活跃于舞台剧、Web剧等领域。\r\n\r\n1995年，4月8日出生于东京都。\r\n2007年，开始以演员身份活动，出演舞台剧等作品。\r\n2011年，在《来自虞美人之坡》中饰演松崎空，声优出道；此后舞台演出有所减少，但演员活动并未停止，仍出演过Web剧与电视宣传片。\r\n2019年，12月31日退出Hirata Office事务所。\r\n2020年，1月1日起以自由身活动，并开设个人推特账号“shiraharu48”；6月1日加入Toy's Factory事务所。\r\n\r\n她的声优之路始于一句不经意的夸奖——演员活动期间常被人说“声音真好听”，当时还在上初中二年级的她从没想过“声音也能当工作”。后来她读了利奥·巴斯卡利亚的绘本《一片叶子落下来》，便把朗读录成声音样本，随《来自虞美人之坡》的试音资料一并送出，竟一举合格，由此正式踏入声优界。\r\n\r\n她从小就是吉卜力的“家学渊源”——父母都是吉卜力粉丝，家里收藏着DVD-BOX，《龙猫》看了无数遍；她最喜欢的角色是草壁梅，家里挂着好几张小梅穿红色连衣裙、戴草帽、抱着玉米的照片，还常去吉卜力美术馆。她憧憬的艺人是神田沙也加。童年时的她是个在公园里跑来跑去、回家就黏着妈妈离不开的小孩。\r\n\r\n特技多才多艺：爵士舞、芭蕾、花道、书法，爱好舞蹈与足球，还喜欢森贝儿家族。有趣的是，由于配音的角色多是“颜艺”属性，久而久之她本人也沾染上了颜艺体质，被粉丝戏称是“被颜艺角色调教出来的白石晴香”。","career":["seiyu","actor"],"id":18600,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/2c/05/58215_prsn_9lEQ0.jpg?r=1699370815","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/2c/05/58215_prsn_9lEQ0.jpg?r=1699370815","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/2c/05/58215_prsn_9lEQ0.jpg?r=1699370815","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/2c/05/58215_prsn_9lEQ0.jpg?r=1699370815"},"name":"穆宣名","short_summary":"台湾女性配音员。台北市立第一女子高级中学、国立台北大学法律学系毕业。华视配音训练班第46期杰出学员。","career":["seiyu"],"id":58215,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":34291},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/4c/05/34292_crt_J33d1.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/4c/05/34292_crt_J33d1.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4c/05/34292_crt_J33d1.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/4c/05/34292_crt_J33d1.jpg"},"name":"ビルク","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/77/d6/18925_prsn_KkrBB.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/77/d6/18925_prsn_KkrBB.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/77/d6/18925_prsn_KkrBB.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/77/d6/18925_prsn_KkrBB.jpg"},"name":"宇山玲加","short_summary":"宇山 玲加（うやま れいか、1994年11月5日 - ）は、日本の女優、声優。神奈川県出身。身長148cm。体重38kg。血液型はAB型。劇団青年座所属。國學院大學文学部日本文学科在学中。","career":["seiyu"],"id":18925,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b3/fe/79188_prsn_cWqRq.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b3/fe/79188_prsn_cWqRq.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b3/fe/79188_prsn_cWqRq.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b3/fe/79188_prsn_cWqRq.jpg"},"name":"楊詩穎","short_summary":"台湾女性配音员，师从姜瑰瑾。","career":["seiyu"],"id":79188,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":34292},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/59/6a/34293_crt_RAzVP.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/59/6a/34293_crt_RAzVP.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/59/6a/34293_crt_RAzVP.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/59/6a/34293_crt_RAzVP.jpg"},"name":"マッティス","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f0/22/5026_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f0/22/5026_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f0/22/5026_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f0/22/5026_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"関貴昭","short_summary":"日本の男性俳優、声優。大阪府出身。演劇集団 円所属。星座は蠍座。","career":["s